{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19867","headline":"病客吟 · 孟郊","name":"病客吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"主人夜呻吟，皆入妻子心。\n客子昼呻吟，徒爲虫鸟音。\n妻子手中病，愁思不复深。\n童仆手中病，忧危独难任。\n丈夫久飘泊，神气自然沈。\n况於滞疾中，何人免嘘𠾬\n大海亦有涯，高山亦有岑。\n沈忧独无极，尘泪互盈襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19867.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19867","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}